; AutoCAD Mechanical Script: Import 3D Solid Enclosure Components
; Usage: In AutoCAD Mechanical, type SCRIPT and select this file.

; 1. Set 3D View to Isometric
VPOINT 1,-1,1

; 2. Import Wall Mount Bracket Solid
IMPORT "C:/Users/Mr_X/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/co_detector_controller/cad/solidworks/CO_Enclosure_Wall_Bracket.step"

; 3. Import Rear Chassis Base Solid
IMPORT "C:/Users/Mr_X/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/co_detector_controller/cad/solidworks/CO_Enclosure_Chassis_Base.step"

; 4. Import Front Housing Cover Solid
IMPORT "C:/Users/Mr_X/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/co_detector_controller/cad/solidworks/CO_Enclosure_Front_Cover.step"

; 5. Set Visual Style to Shaded with Edges
VSMINCURRENT SHADEDWITHEDGES

; 6. Zoom Extents
ZOOM E
